  "origin": "Multiple web scrapes of Danish municipal websites, collected across different municipal domains as part of the AI-aktindsigt project (ai-aktindsigt.dk). The dynaword subset is derived from the source dataset AI-aktindsigt/Skrabet_kommunale_hjemmesider. 200.91K samples, 139.23M Llama-3 tokens; document created-dates range from 2010 to March 2024.",
